         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nUntil now, we have always used the same group of numbers. Because of this, we might think that our way of counting is the only one that exists, and that humanity has never created any other numerical system.\n\nIn this class, we will begin studying other counting systems created by humanity that are no longer used today.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
