         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### How Does It Work?\n\nA quipu has a main horizontal string. From it hang vertical strings with knots that represent numbers.\n\nBesides numbers, quipus also used colors. This allowed the quipumakers to record even more precise information.\n\nIn our classes, we will represent the quipus' knots with circles.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 230\" width=\"320\" height=\"230\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#8B6914\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#C49A6C\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#C49A6C\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2C3E50\">1</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2C3E50\">2</text></svg>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
