            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "6e9bef8c-6ec5-4c04-b583-aea8e6bbec5b",
               "text": "Quesada, Eugenio de",
               "page": "https://www.rahf.es/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/EL-ECO_articulo-LOS-CHASQUIS-II_Eugenio-de-Quesada.pdf",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2016",
                  "month": "08",
                  "day": "04"
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Large Numbers\n\nFor larger numbers, the quipumakers used levels of knots. In the two quipus below, we represent the numbers 12 and 21.\n\nNotice that the quipus are aligned: the units are always the knots at the bottom, and the tens are the next group above.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 320\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#8B6914\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#C49A6C\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"205\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"175\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#8B6914\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#C49A6C\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"205\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8B6914\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2C3E50\">12</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2C3E50\">21</text></svg>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "7d19f039-627e-4940-a17f-f898ff9c9591",
